{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a surrounded beast and move to avoid the attacks of the beast tide. Keep upgrading to gain stronger abilities, mowing down enemies like grass, and become the legendary divine beast!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a unique way of attacking: the Blue Dragon represents celestial phenomena, the Black Tortoise represents defense, the Vermilion Bird represents fire, the White Tiger represents killing, the Qilin represents lightning, and the Taotie represents devouring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synergy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By choices,construct different schools of magics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few enemies have special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759180/extras/e002df582a09e7192ebdd8c88d24db7d.avif?t=1771393396\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spiritual pet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759180/extras/ccc517b40f996d7aab121a0744dd853d.avif?t=1771393396\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter a strange egg on the way, breaking it will grant you a spirit pet. Take it and break through the siege together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an initial survival mode mode and an endless mode set up for challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The scale of the beast tide will increase over time. To survive, you must enhance your strength as soon as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Pick up experience balls to level up, and they won't disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7There are some enemies with special abilities. If you don't deal with them properly, you'll be caught off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7If you are lucky, you will encounter all kinds of rare treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The &quot;DaoFa&quot; that can be constructed are limited. It's advisable to give it more thought when making a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7You can hide in the grass for a short time. If you can't defeat the beast tide, hide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The duration of each game in the survival mode is within 20 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaven and Earth are impartial, treating all things as straw dogs. How many sentient beings seek to become deities and attain immortality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a unique beast surrounded by a tide of beasts. Only by surviving can you have a chance to become a legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759180?t=1771393396","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759180?t=1771393396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759180/146cf14ce2ecca7cd5a4d71451f397d5c68fd455/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771393396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759180/146cf14ce2ecca7cd5a4d71451f397d5c68fd455/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771393396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a surrounded beast and move to avoid the attacks of the beast tide. Keep upgrading to gain stronger abilities, mowing down enemies like grass, and become the legendary divine beast!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a unique way of attacking: the Blue Dragon represents celestial phenomena, the Black Tortoise represents defense, the Vermilion Bird represents fire, the White Tiger represents killing, the Qilin represents lightning, and the Taotie represents devouring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synergy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By choices,construct different schools of magics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few enemies have special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759180/extras/e002df582a09e7192ebdd8c88d24db7d.avif?t=1771393396\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spiritual pet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759180/extras/ccc517b40f996d7aab121a0744dd853d.avif?t=1771393396\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter a strange egg on the way, breaking it will grant you a spirit pet. Take it and break through the siege together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an initial survival mode mode and an endless mode set up for challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The scale of the beast tide will increase over time. To survive, you must enhance your strength as soon as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Pick up experience balls to level up, and they won't disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7There are some enemies with special abilities. If you don't deal with them properly, you'll be caught off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7If you are lucky, you will encounter all kinds of rare treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The &quot;DaoFa&quot; that can be constructed are limited. It's advisable to give it more thought when making a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7You can hide in the grass for a short time. If you can't defeat the beast tide, hide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The duration of each game in the survival mode is within 20 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaven and Earth are impartial, treating all things as straw dogs. How many sentient beings seek to become deities and attain immortality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a unique beast surrounded by a tide of beasts. Only by surviving can you have a chance to become a legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u6563\u6728"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759180/e607371c63362fa1447ad7d12bfa46f4c4ef0f29/header.jpg?t=1771393396","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759180/356451719/1ae0944ce4918eeda831dd9bf86bc09a04cecffe/1771138567/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771156682","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759180/356451719/1ae0944ce4918eeda831dd9bf86bc09a04cecffe/1771138567/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771156682","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759180/356451719/1ae0944ce4918eeda831dd9bf86bc09a04cecffe/1771138567/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771156682","id":257191084,"name":"\u5f02\u517d\u5c71\u6d77","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat